{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/About_the_game.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavy clouds that contain Mycopsychosis spores are approaching your area. If you want to survive, you have to stay inside your home and closely follow the PCD (plague control department)\u00a0issued rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this visual novel, you will experience a sporestorm firsthand. You'll be tasked not only with surviving the night but also with taking care of the people around you. Explore the scenario, meet and interact with our charismatic main cast, and decide if you trust them enough to let them inside your house or if you'd rather not risk it. Be carefull, sometimes issolation is not the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/OnnaVentana.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To enhance the experience and to help the player survive, a web page has been created by the\u00a0PCD\u00a0containing crucial information about the spores, the infection and about those who fall ill from it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In case you don't have an active internet connection, we've also included the information inside the &quot;Survivor manual&quot; folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/HugoVentana.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/About_Us.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/Aboutus.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807550?t=1753774680","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/c60f6484b1e34689a5b455699072460e1ce18a72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753774680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/379db61d4087c123df2472f718d506bf98f30440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753774680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/379db61d4087c123df2472f718d506bf98f30440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753774680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Characters dying from a fiction fungi infection[Horror body & Gore]. \r\nThere are some psychological horror aspects to their deaths.\r\nALL the visuals are drawn in anime style-\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83c\udf44UPDATES &amp; ANNOUNCEMENTS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/SteamWishlishtDiscord.gif?t=1753774680\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/About_the_game.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavy clouds that contain Mycopsychosis spores are approaching your area. If you want to survive, you have to stay inside your home and closely follow the PCD (plague control department)\u00a0issued rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this visual novel, you will experience a sporestorm firsthand. You'll be tasked not only with surviving the night but also with taking care of the people around you. Explore the scenario, meet and interact with our charismatic main cast, and decide if you trust them enough to let them inside your house or if you'd rather not risk it. Be carefull, sometimes issolation is not the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/OnnaVentana.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To enhance the experience and to help the player survive, a web page has been created by the\u00a0PCD\u00a0containing crucial information about the spores, the infection and about those who fall ill from it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In case you don't have an active internet connection, we've also included the information inside the &quot;Survivor manual&quot; folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/HugoVentana.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/About_Us.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/extras/Aboutus.png?t=1753774680\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["DeltaCat Studio "],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807550/0f06a709bcb7ce73e6ec4918853ef07a9dfe3515/header.jpg?t=1753774680","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Apple</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight"